stic that defines a Trigonometric Identity, distinguishing it from a general trigonometric equation?','mcq','[\"It only involves sine and cosine functions.\", \"It is true only for specific values of the variable.\", \"It is an equation that is true for *all* valid values of the variable.\", \"It is used exclusively for solving right triangles.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-10 08:28:03.967472','71afc962f2104a6abeb7d480f6c4dd80'),('bde9506d0eb84ea8b0f5a31c9e63bc1e','How do you convert a radian measure to degrees?','mcq','[\"Multiply the radian measure by pi / 180.\", \"Multiply the radian measure by 180 / pi.\", \"Multiply the radian measure by 2 * pi.\", \"Multiply the radian measure by 360 / pi.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-10 08:28:03.796325','3923bddcbc8a412fae18621ffcdbbd4c'),('be13be8748c14d64a0f446f3c4b26ab7','What does the \"order\" of an Ordinary Differential Equation (ODE) signify?','mcq','[\"The number of independent variables.\", \"The number of unknown functions.\", \"The highest order derivative present in the equation.\", \"The complexity of the solution method.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-10 04:11:14.264000','aae4ce9acb1c4afeba814726a675d550'),('bee0669092c74d0583a859ac9c53e4fd','Which file is specifically mentioned as being created by Django when starting a project and is used for project-wide configurations?','mcq','[\"`models.py`\", \"`views.py`\", \"`settings.py`\", \"`app.py`\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 16:49:32.803000','ab9fc04dfb08474b81448a4cd33f8167'),('bf081879d82e46aa9c7c320916186acf','What is the defining characteristic of a right triangle?','mcq','[\"It has three equal sides.\", \"It contains one angle that measures exactly 90 degrees.\", \"All its angles are less than 90 degrees.\", \"It has two sides of equal length.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-08 12:59:32.785000','f122771124df48edb04289b340bf1e22'),('bf22a946e86f4a809f129e9e50641b11','A first-order Ordinary Differential Equation (ODE) involves which of the following?','mcq','[\"Only the second derivative of the unknown function.\", \"Only the first derivative of the unknown function.\", \"Derivatives up to the third order.\", \"No derivatives at all, only the function itself.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 12:21:30.307000','1c18e83623634608a445f8410a760a8c'),('bfa19e559a3d48e7a6846aad2028a28b','What does \"ODE\" stand for in the context of Second-Order Linear Homogeneous ODEs?','mcq','[\"Ordinary Differential Equation\", \"Oscillatory Dynamic Equation\", \"Optimal Derivative Expression\", \"Orderly Dependent Equation\"]','0',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.280000','0a43196b3ca94ea9b55f955d79081eb5'),('c123400a5fcf430b8094540cacfb0032','What characteristic defines an ODE as \"Second-Order\"?','mcq','[\"It involves two independent variables.\", \"The unknown function appears to the second power.\", \"The highest derivative present in the equation is the second derivative.\", \"It has exactly two terms on the left-hand side.\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.282000','0a43196b3ca94ea9b55f955d79081eb5'),('cced40d73c1b4a6da70b7b014ca0c2a2','Which keyword is used to declare a variable whose value can be reassigned later in JavaScript?','mcq','[\"`const`\", \"`var`\", \"`let`\", \"`static`\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 13:25:59.714000','b5632b45519049c494b634084e77c2a8'),('cdab51f05bf749b5b7da4e4feb4d1ac9','A differential equation is fundamentally an equation that relates a function with what?','mcq','[\"Its constants.\", \"Its variables.\", \"Its derivatives.\", \"Its limits.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.203000','826bbc0263b34345b167ee6f0d969cab'),('cf0af8761d7a416f9524a808c55589d4','In a Second-Order Linear Homogeneous ODE, what does the term \"Homogeneous\" signify?','mcq','[\"All coefficients are constant.\", \"The equation has only one solution.\", \"The right-hand side of the equation is zero.\", \"The equation involves only even derivatives.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.283000','0a43196b3ca94ea9b55f955d79081eb5'),('d54c593dba4b4a2a9b2d058c69fd5158','When an angle in standard position has a negative measure, how does its terminal side rotate?','mcq','[\"Counter-clockwise from the positive x-axis.\", \"Clockwise from the positive x-axis.\", \"It remains stationary on the positive x-axis.\", \"It rotates randomly without a fixed direction.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 11:51:31.744000','759235b9d57a406fb2d43c1b09ddb086'),('d63b2d7916f84ab5baf60b2a2efbcff9','An angle measuring 75° would be classified as which type of angle?','mcq','[\"Right Angle\", \"Obtuse Angle\", \"Acute Angle\", \"Straight Angle\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-08 11:47:28.913000','491ae6426cb347c5b61af6bdbc1e92b2'),('d73a37100e7a4cc797a45a7cfbb105af','In a right triangle, which side is always the longest and directly opposite the 90-degree angle?','mcq','[\"The adjacent side\", \"The opposite side\", \"The hypotenuse\", \"A leg\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 12:59:32.788000','f122771124df48edb04289b340bf1e22'),('d7784cb12c9142b5a962e4cc67d44604','According to the text, what is a Django Project primarily defined as?','mcq','[\"A single Python file containing all application logic.\", \"A self-contained module handling a specific feature.\", \"A collection of configurations and applications that make up a complete web application.\", \"A database management system for web applications.\"]','2',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-08 16:49:32.798000','ab9fc04dfb08474b81448a4cd33f8167'),('d831d9e3621b485cb475f8822125680c','After solving a differential equation in the s-domain using Laplace Transforms, what is the next crucial step to obtain the solution in the original domain?','mcq','[\"Apply another Laplace Transform.\", \"Use the inverse Laplace Transform.\", \"Convert it back to an algebraic equation.\", \"Solve it again using elementary methods.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.380000','580ab48eb18e4e8baee457a0401cc668'),('d91c2337d514469485b86d2fca95c529','According to the text, how does \"State\" contribute to \"Enabling Dynamic UIs\"?','mcq','[\"By allowing components to receive static data from parent components.\", \"By holding data that changes over time, triggering efficient UI re-renders.\", \"By promoting the creation of generic, reusable components.\", \"By defining the initial structure of a component before any interaction.\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-08 13:12:16.853000','ff8aac3e77954f00aa8104edb373050c'),('d965b52e17134311a5e05770c3b405c7','If you are focusing on a specific acute angle in a right triangle, how is the \"Opposite Side\" defined?','mcq','[\"It is the side next to the angle, not the hypotenuse.\", \"It is the longest side of the triangle.\", \"It is the side directly across from the angle you are focusing on.\", \"It is the side opposite the 90-degree angle.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 11:58:55.659000','03df8683f297479395dcaaa941564c91'),('db65a6ba2791458e89661471c95846bb','What is the defining characteristic of a first-order differential equation regarding its derivatives?','mcq','[\"It involves only second derivatives.\", \"The highest derivative present is the first derivative.\", \"It relates a function to its integral.\", \"It contains no derivatives at all.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.201000','826bbc0263b34345b167ee6f0d969cab'),('e0991c8e34bc40e8b2ad79b0b0d15d23','If you are focusing on an acute angle \'X\' in a right triangle, and side \'A\' is directly across from angle \'X\', while side \'B\' is next to angle \'X\' but is not the hypotenuse, how would you label sides \'A\' and \'B\' respectively?','mcq','[\"A: Adjacent, B: Opposite\", \"A: Hypotenuse, B: Opposite\", \"A: Opposite, B: Adjacent\", \"A: Opposite, B: Hypotenuse\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-08 12:07:50.561000','670b202c2b2c48afb3656a5d17357b9f'),('e0b01975537b4aa98587d15a46610696','What is a key characteristic of Python\'s syntax that enhances code readability?','mcq','[\"Use of semicolons to terminate statements\", \"Case-sensitivity for variable names\", \"Indentation to define code blocks\", \"Use of curly braces to enclose code blocks\"]','2',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-18 15:47:10.038000','5a37bdf1b08e450a873e7a3f08f960ec'),('e29d201a0b3244808a5408bf47147339','According to the text, which of the following real-world scenarios can be modeled using First-Order Ordinary Differential Equations?','mcq','[\"Predicting population growth.\", \"Designing circuits.\", \"Understanding how quickly coffee cools down.\", \"All of the above.\"]','3',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-10 04:12:08.149000','90d62550c0d54237947475f5e801a6f6'),('e43c64d26bfb4dd786e1e90167b6742d','What is the primary role of Node.js core modules?','mcq','[\"To provide third-party libraries for specific use cases.\", \"To offer essential built-in functionalities like file system access and HTTP server creation.\", \"To manage frontend UI components.\", \"To compile JavaScript code into machine language.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 13:17:37.696000','2942df64080146d4b8ed6664c0ad1698'),('e460b86e01934f309d5695712485bfc1','What is the primary function of the Event Loop in Node.js?','mcq','[\"To create a new thread for every incoming request.\", \"To block execution until an I/O operation is complete.\", \"To continuously check for new events and dispatch them to callback functions, enabling concurrent operations.\", \"To compile JavaScript code before execution.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 13:17:37.700000','2942df64080146d4b8ed6664c0ad1698'),('e47618d9cbff40c2aa1d73372f80c98b','Which of the following statements correctly identifies the data types for the given values based on Python\'s inference?','mcq','[\"`\'100\'` is an `int`, `5.0` is a `str`.\", \"`20` is a `float`, `3.14` is an `int`.\", \"`\\\"Python\\\"` is a `str`, `42` is an `int`.\", \"`0.75` is an `int`, `\'True\'` is a `bool`.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 17:16:38.121000','9cd0f04a76c145e783f5a5d9d16b9166'),('e55582e559634762a265949d9031b242','What is the period for the basic sine and cosine functions (sin(x) and cos(x))?','mcq','[\"π radians\", \"3π/2 radians\", \"2π radians\", \"π/2 radians\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-10 08:28:04.089323','0b70b73bb0724d8ab38231710baff8ad'),('e7d4a50c6da04c4299004f3f156591d0','What is the primary reason for graphing trigonometric functions like sine and cosine?','mcq','[\"To calculate the area under a curve.\", \"To visualize repeating, predictable patterns.\", \"To find the exact value of an angle.\", \"To determine the hypotenuse of a right-angled triangle.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-10 08:28:04.077322','0b70b73bb0724d8ab38231710baff8ad'),('e8085a9f644b4c309ab20b4e00494ec3','What key property do the Sine, Cosine, and Tangent ratios share regarding a given angle?','mcq','[\"They change depending on the size of the right triangle.\", \"They are constant for a given angle, regardless of the size of the right triangle.\", \"They are only applicable to 45-degree angles.\", \"They are always equal to each other.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 13:06:29.641000','688bcdacc17b4a498892e9e76f9327ae'),('ea70c70b5b4b4339a00cb0e62abfe194','Which of the following is the general form of a second-order linear non-homogeneous ODE as described in the text?','mcq','[\"`a y\' + b y = f(x)`\", \"`a y\'\' + b y\' + c y = f(x)`\", \"`a y\'\' + b y\' + c y = 0`\", \"`y\'\' = f(x)`\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.310000','bf188003cab7489f994226630f178712'),('eb9518878aea41ea9dd5d1f43e3b4244','According to the text, what is Right Triangle Trigonometry primarily used for?','mcq','[\"To design circular structures.\", \"To find unknown sides and angles in right-angled triangles.\", \"To calculate the area of any triangle.\", \"To determine the volume of three-dimensional shapes.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 12:59:32.790000','f122771124df48edb04289b340bf1e22'),('ec6e2e03f3774b81b827481e1a9ae3a8','When focusing on a specific acute angle in a right triangle (the angle of reference), which side is directly across from it?','mcq','[\"The Hypotenuse\", \"The Adjacent Side\", \"The Opposite Side\", \"The 90-degree angle side\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 11:47:29.015000','64a5ab1b9a8e4be3b8592d4fcbf8f20d'),('ed1034c72679461f8c8a096e5093b234','In the context of a right triangle, how is the sine (sin) function defined?','mcq','[\"Adjacent side / Hypotenuse\", \"Opposite side / Hypotenuse\", \"Opposite side / Adjacent side\", \"Hypotenuse / Opposite side\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-10 08:28:03.950171','71afc962f2104a6abeb7d480f6c4dd80'),('ee9ec29a49ce4f9298ed15f7a7a727ac','According to the text, what is a primary reason the Unit Circle has a radius of 1?','mcq','[\"To make the circumference equal to pi.\", \"To simplify calculations and directly represent sine and cosine values with coordinates.\", \"To ensure it fits perfectly within a 2x2 square.\", \"To match the standard length of a protractor.\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-08 11:51:31.742000','759235b9d57a406fb2d43c1b09ddb086'),('f43ab66e4c22447eb77a428f361b4d89','How is the \"order\" of a differential equation determined?','mcq','[\"By the number of variables present.\", \"By the highest derivative present.\", \"By the number of terms in the equation.\", \"By whether it is linear or non-linear.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.206000','826bbc0263b34345b167ee6f0d969cab'),('f56e50e5b9c242559be19c2a51df43b9','Which of the following is an example of a `boolean` data type in JavaScript?','mcq','[\"`\\\"Hello\\\"`\", \"`100`\", \"`true`\", \"`{ key: \\\"value\\\" }`\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 13:25:59.715000','b5632b45519049c494b634084e77c2a8'),('f8cde61a64ea461aaef6ed4dc53e34f8','If you are focusing on a specific acute angle in a right triangle, how is the \"Opposite Side\" identified?','mcq','[\"It is the side next to the acute angle, but not the hypotenuse.\", \"It is the longest side of the triangle.\", \"It is the side directly across from (opposite) the specific acute angle.\", \"It is the side that forms the 90-degree angle.\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-08 17:01:49.739000','a7fb522bd62546d9b06810a8c5579b76'),('fbf37a673c644aeda15ab9cf4dc03b1b','What data type would you use to store a collection of unique, unordered items in Python?','mcq','[\"List\", \"Tuple\", \"Set\", \"Dictionary\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-18 15:47:10.053000','5a37bdf1b08e450a873e7a3f08f960ec'),('fdac5aff5830433ca648d4321d7cbf5c','In Python, what is the primary purpose of a variable?','mcq','[\"To define a new function in the program.\", \"To store and manage data by giving a name to a value.\", \"To execute a block of code repeatedly.\", \"To declare the type of data a value will hold before assignment.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-08 17:16:38.111000','9cd0f04a76c145e783f5a5d9d16b9166');
